sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as Service metier
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NG as Angular (sidebar)
    actor U as Utilisateur cible

    Note over SRC: un evenement se produit<br/>(candidature recue, rapport valide...)
    SRC->>NS: notifierXxx(userId, titre, message)
    NS->>DB: insert notification (lu=false, userId)

    loop toutes les 60 s
        NG->>DB: GET /api/notifications/non-lues
        DB-->>NG: liste + compteur
    end
    NG-->>U: badge cloche + espace /notifications

    U->>NG: marque comme lue
    NG->>DB: PATCH /api/notifications/{id}/lue
